Your Trading Economics API key goes here, on a single line, e.g.:

    client:secret

Then rename/copy this file's CONTENTS (just the key, not this help text) to your
Switch SD card at:

    sdmc:/te_apikey.txt

Do NOT commit your real key. `te_apikey.txt` is gitignored for that reason.
Without a key the app falls back to sample INDOGB values automatically.

Get a key at https://developer.tradingeconomics.com/ . Each user must use their
own key — keys are per-account and must not be shared or embedded in a public build.
